From dc6cc71266b18a37f43b07ba8e8b3c1f75c58113 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: atomozero <bernardi.andrea@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 16:49:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 104/270] i2c: add a driver for the NVIDIA Tegra 2 I2C master
 controllers

Packet mode, polled: clocks the controller from PLLP at 8 times the bus
clock of the device tree, and resets it after a failed transfer. The DVC
controller is left to the kernel, which reads the clock of the power
management IC behind it.

Add the I2C bus manager, this driver and the i2c tool to the ARM image, to
probe the audio codec and the panel DDC.
